#. notice
#: src/js/appraisal-model.js:232
msgctxt "text:notice"
msgid ""
"Kourindou separated “knowing the purpose” from “knowing how to operate it,” "
"adding one page to every form."
msgstr "香霖堂今日把「知道用途」與「知道怎麼用」分成兩個欄位，表格因此多了一頁。"

#. appraisalDeskStatus
#: src/js/appraisal-model.js:235
msgctxt "text:appraisalDeskStatus"
msgid ""
"Returning holdings occupy two benches; object 31 was just mistaken for a "
"bookmark by a dictionary."
msgstr "返航館藏佔用了兩張鑑定桌；第 31 件耳機剛被一本辭典誤認為書籤。"

#. appraisalDeskStatus
#: src/js/appraisal-model.js:238
msgctxt "text:appraisalDeskStatus.2"
msgid ""
"Nitori brought a reversible adapter box and tape. The library recognizes "
"only the former as method."
msgstr "荷取帶了可逆轉接箱，也帶了膠帶。館方只承認前者屬於方法。"

#. appraisalDeskStatus
#: src/js/appraisal-model.js:240
msgctxt "text:appraisalDeskStatus.3"
msgid "Bamboo humidity is up. Sleeves enter drying boxes; all camera shutter tests are paused."
msgstr "竹林濕氣提高，所有紙套先入乾燥盒；相機案卷暫停任何快門測試。"

#. communityCopy.author
#: src/js/appraisal-model.js:253
msgctxt "text:communityCopy.author"
msgid "Kourindou × Misty Lake Cataloguing Desk"
msgstr "香霖堂 × 霧湖編目桌"

#. communityCopy.contestedAuthor
#: src/js/appraisal-model.js:253
msgctxt "text:communityCopy.contestedAuthor"
msgid "Bunbunmaru Corrections-Candidate Desk"
msgstr "文文。校報訂正候補欄"

#. communityCopy.supported
#: src/js/appraisal-model.js:253
msgctxt "text:communityCopy.supported"
msgid "Drift-object appraisal completed"
msgstr "漂流物鑑定完成"

#. communityCopy.provisional
#: src/js/appraisal-model.js:253
msgctxt "text:communityCopy.provisional"
msgid "Drift object provisionally catalogued"
msgstr "漂流物暫定編目"

#. communityCopy.contested
#: src/js/appraisal-model.js:253
msgctxt "text:communityCopy.contested"
msgid "An unsupported use retained by request"
msgstr "一項不成立但被要求保留的用途"

#. communityCopy.warning
#: src/js/appraisal-model.js:253
msgctxt "text:communityCopy.warning"
msgid ""
"Evidence did not support the proposed original use; the file remains a "
"red-pencil contested record."
msgstr "原用途未獲證據支持；案卷以紅鉛筆爭議件保存。"
